weet_count": 189}, "text": "A biological attack is planned for Saturday \n\n600 million pounds of sugar laced with synthetic chemicals will enter the bodies of our children. \n\nWreaking metabolic havoc, injuring vascular architecture, acidifying oral lining, releasing bacterial toxins, and blunting neural", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2114379918213894223"}, {"author_id": "61559439", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:24:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114377680715980950"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 149, "start": 139, "tag": "NVIDIAGTC"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8nJReDvmH7", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114377680715980950/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114377565158662144", "start": 249, "url": "https://t.co/8nJReDvmH7"}]}, "id": "2114377680715980950", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 48774, "like_count": 454, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 81, "retweet_count": 52}, "text": "Europe is building its AI future, and we’re all in. \n\nFrom AI factories and AI agents to robotics and healthcare, Jensen took the stage at #NVIDIAGTC Berlin to show how AI is taking shape across the continent.\n\nHere's a look back at the highlights: https://t.co/8nJReDvmH7", "url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114377680715980950"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114371403726377409"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OeEo9u4e7H", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2114371403726377409/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113541553490632704", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/OeEo9u4e7H"}]}, "id": "2114371403726377409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3058, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "As the global interest in nuclear energy continues to grow, the IAEA Nuclear Power Ministerial “In Focus” sessions will explore some of the tren