08470882798"}, {"author_id": "3169963433", "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:01:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114009293544366267"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lY7q6whXtT", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2114009293544366267/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114009291061370880", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/lY7q6whXtT"}]}, "id": "2114009293544366267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 77, "impression_count": 44930, "like_count": 474, "quote_count": 16, "reply_count": 55, "retweet_count": 143}, "text": "The world is getting more of its electricity from renewables but less from nuclear power.\n\nIf the world is to reduce its carbon emissions and tackle climate change, it needs to move away from fossil fuels to low-carbon power.\n\nThere are two key sources of low-carbon electricity: https://t.co/lY7q6whXtT", "url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2114009293544366267"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:45:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114005261757149242"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 236, "id": "204375452", "start": 226, "username": "OLACDEORG"}], "urls": [{"description": "Can Latin America and the Caribbean’s workforce keep pace with the energy boom? - A commentary by Michael McGovern, Gaston Siroit, Clarisa Proietti, Blandine Barreau", "display_url": "iea.li/4rTJFi5", "end": 284, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4rTJFi5", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112236883900022785/OyQicH0b?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112236883900022785/OyQicH0b?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 261, "status": 200, "title": "Can Latin America and the Caribbean’s workforce keep pace with the energy boom? - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/commentaries/can-latin-america-and-the-caribbeans-workforce-keep-pace-with-the-energy-boom?utm_content=bufferbef29&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/GcOK0P3oTz"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/yIHUVihz3v", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2114005261757149242/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114005259525746689", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/yIHUVihz3v"}]}, "id": "2114005261757149242", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3488, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "The energy sector in Latin America &amp; the Caribbean is booming – with over 750 thousand jobs added since 2019\n\nBut sustaining this momentum will depend on building a workforce with the right skills\n\nOur new commentary with @OLACDEORG explores what’s needed: https://t.co/GcOK0P3oTz https://t.co/yIHUVihz3v", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2114005261757149242"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:44:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114005212146827588"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RpsAgainstTrum…", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RpsAgainstTrump/status/2113422988418646137", "start": 231, "url": "https://t.co/4EeBMIVy3F"}]}, "id": "2114005212146827588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2875, "like_count": 87, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113422988418646137", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The story seems legit. How far the US has fallen from the shining city on a hill I believed existed when I was younger. I hope it gets rid of the current corrupt cult in a cleansing fire instead of tumbling further into the abyss. https://t.co/4EeBMIVy3F", "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2114005212146827588"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:22:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113999480399790144"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kY0QsRPXCg", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2113999480399790144/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113999474611634176", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/kY0QsRPXCg"}]}, "id": "2113999480399790144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 14361, "like_count": 313, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 263, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "I believe that this is complex for some people, but Hitlers \"National Socialism\" is a subcategory of (right wing) fascism.\n\nAlso, what Amercans call socialism is more properly labeled (historically speaking) \"social democracy\". Scandinavia, Germany and my country are examples. https://t.co/kY0QsRPXCg", "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2113999480399790144"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:57:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113993372876624170"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/AukeHoekstra/s…", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2113992480974676037", "start": 253, "url": "https://t.co/KHj5N1lT9g"}]}, "id": "2113993372876624170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2122, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113992480974676037", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Not the most important news in the world but I have to correct myself. In discussions I claimed the outside door handles of the Tesla were mechanical. I was wrong and I'm sorry to have misinformed.\n(And FYI: I think mechanical handles are a good idea.) https://t.co/KHj5N1lT9g", "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2113993372876624170"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:45:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113990167245545578"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Electricity Mid-Year Update 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "buff.ly/ONV80UL", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/ONV80UL", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113990216276963328/MLFCmoax?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113990216276963328/MLFCmoax?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 254, "status": 200, "title": "Executive summary - Electricity Mid-Year Update 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-mid-year-update-2026/executive-summary?utm_content=buffer0aa6d&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/HtriphSz5e"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/iQnG1iFQQL", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113990167245545578/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113990165114785792", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/iQnG1iFQQL"}]}, "id": "2113990167245545578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 4225, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "The LNG price shock resulting from Hormuz disruptions has translated into higher wholesale electricity prices in markets where LNG plays a key role.\n\nAverage spot electricity prices in the EU &amp; Japan rose by over 30% year-on-year during Q2 of 2026 👉 https://t.co/HtriphSz5e https://t.co/iQnG1iFQQL", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113990167245545578"}, {"author_id": "166252256", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:44:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113989768195219815", "2113989940858237030"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 23, "id": "972120528667467776", "start": 7, "username": "ScienceUnderSec"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7RnLmdBqwI", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2113989940858237030/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113989693956059137", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/7RnLmdBqwI"}]}, "id": "2113989940858237030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 11339, "like_count": 180, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 54}, "text": "ICYMI: @ScienceUnderSec on the power of President Trump's Ge