"https://atoms.iaea.org/4Bfwc8x", "start": 141, "status": 200, "title": "Annual Report 2025 | IAEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iaea.org/interactive/annual-report/2025/", "url": "https://t.co/iWN8zdtyjt"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/ta7853YvUs", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113978482523095163/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113978274686607360", "start": 165, "url": "https://t.co/ta7853YvUs"}]}, "id": "2113978482523095163", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 5359, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Watch Director General @rafaelmgrossi present IAEA’s 2025 Annual Report to the @UN General Assembly #UNGA.\n\n📘 Full report is available here: https://t.co/iWN8zdtyjt https://t.co/ta7853YvUs", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113978482523095163"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-24T12:45:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113975066513842518"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The soaring cost of shipping is lifting the price of oil for consumers - A commentary by Daniel Gymer, David Martin", "display_url": "iea.li/4BfDtoR", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4BfDtoR", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112862008337133568/_K35Ds7A?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112862008337133568/_K35Ds7A?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 251, "status": 200, "title": "The soaring cost of shipping is lifting the price of oil for consumers - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/commentaries/the-soaring-cost-of-shipping-is-lifting-the-price-of-oil-for-consumers?utm_content=bufferb3699&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/bHl85JhsUL"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uBk2hcalf0", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113975066513842518/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113975064433504257", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/uBk2hcalf0"}]}, "id": "2113975066513842518", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3357, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "The price of oil is only part of what determines the cost to supply the world with fuel.\n \nWith tanker rates at historic highs amid disruptions in the Middle East, rising shipping costs are adding further pressure to global oil markets.\n \nRead more 👉 https://t.co/bHl85JhsUL https://t.co/uBk2hcalf0", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113975066513842518"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:45:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113959959759040865"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A price worth paying? A mineral security premium as insurance against supply disruptions - A commentary by Shobhan Dhir, Tae-Yoon Kim", "display_url": "iea.li/3VhyfbH", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/3VhyfbH", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112646365717159936/tVn-ObaS?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112646365717159936/tVn-ObaS?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 254, "status": 200, "title": "A price worth paying? A mineral security premium as insurance against supply disruptions - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/commentaries/a-price-worth-paying-a-mineral-security-premium-as-insurance-against-supply-disruptions?utm_content=bufferf4ba0&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/uhkbIrbSwl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/u69jrY09Ez", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113959959759040865/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113959956273659904", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/u69jrY09Ez"}]}, "id": "2113959959759040865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3549, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Diversifying magnet rare earth supply chains to meet projected demand outside of China in 2035 would cost about $60 billion\n \nBut this is modest compared to the potential economic impact of a supply shock, which could reach around $6.5 trillion a year 👉 https://t.co/uhkbIrbSwl https://t.co/u69jrY09Ez", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113959959759040865"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-10-24T08:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113903319601344865"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 12, "start": 6, "tag": "UNDay"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6Nza0Vqwit", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113903319601344865/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113589919725547520", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/6Nza0Vqwit"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/6Nza0Vqwit", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113903319601344865/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113589974809317376", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/6Nza0Vqwit"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/6Nza0Vqwit", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113903319601344865/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113590012105072640", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/6Nza0Vqwit"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/6Nza0Vqwit", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113903319601344865/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113590200139948032", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/6Nza0Vqwit"}]}, "id": "2113903319601344865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3972, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Happy #UNDay!\n\nThe IAEA is proud to be part of the United Nations family in Vienna, supporting countries around the globe through nuclear science — from expanding access to cancer care and strengthening food security to protecting the environment and enhancing nuclear safety. https://t.co/6Nza0Vqwit", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113903319601344865"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-24T03:14:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113831472310395360"], "id": "2113831472310395360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 61, "impression_count": 89496, "like_count": 1592, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 78, "retweet_count": 52}, "text": "Security vulnerabilities are freaking everyone out.\n\nBut you know what, humanity will win this tussle and then with equal gusto, it will do the same with our bodies: patching all our aging and disease vulnerabilities.", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2113831472310395360"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "84679163", "name": "International Energy Agency", "username": "IEA"}, {"id": "17468569", "name": "Bryan Johnson", "username": "bryan_johnson"}, {"id": "61559439", "name": "NVIDIA", "username": "nvidia"}, {"id": "19386622", "name": "IAEA - International Atomic Energy Agency ⚛️", "username": "iaeaorg"}, {"id": "166252256", "name": "U.S. Department of Energy", "username": "ENERGY"}, {"id": "4939401", "name": "Patrick Collison", "username": "patrickc"}, {"id": "3169963433", "name": "Our World in Data", "username": "OurWorldInData"}, {"id": "16933019", "name": "AukeHoekstra", "username": "AukeHoekstra"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2114382749704323189", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtzopfyemav39fcu6gzwvoakcd", "oldest_id": "2113831472310395360", "result_count": 25}}
